SUBJECT:
Sweetgrass Annexation Postponement Request (UDC-17-00542)
City Councilmembers and Madam Mayor,
The applicants for the Sweetgrass Annexation (Item #7 on the December 11, 2017 City Council Agenda)
have requested that the ordinance be postponed several times in order to work on an annexation
agreement related to that item. The City Attorney’s Office first received a draft of that annexation
agreement from the applicants on December 6, 2017. The City Attorney’s Office and Planning and
Development Department have been coordinating a review of this draft with City agencies that would be
affected by the agreement.
As the holiday meeting schedule is compressed, it would not be possible to perform an adequate review
of the document in time to circulate a final draft of the agreement before the next Public Services
Committee on December 112017. As a result we will be requesting a postponement of this item to the
January 8th meeting of the Governing Body. We have discussed this request with the agent for the
applicants and he is amenable to a postponement of the item.
Please contact Alessandra McCoy (x6310) or myself if you have any questions regarding this request.
Regards,
Eric Hammer, LEED AP Neighborhood Development
Planner, Planning and Development Department
ehammer@cheyennecity.org
(307) 638-4342
